<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">According to our records, you received an incomplete grade in the following course(s) for SEMESTER, for which the Incomplete Grade Request Form has not yet been filed.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">•<span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">	</span></font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></div><div><font face="arial">The deadline to submit the form is DATE. Please work with the instructor of record for each course in which an incomplete grade was issued to submit the Incomplete Grade Request Form no later than August 28.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">You may download the <a href="https://students.asu.edu/forms/incomplete-grade-request">Incomplete Graduate Request form</a>.</font></div><div><font face="arial">Once the form has been completed, with the instructor¹s signature, submit the form to the School of Music Office of Academic Affairs, Music E167.</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">After August 28, a registration hold for fall 2016 will be placed on your account, preventing you from registering or altering your fall 2016 schedule until the missing Incomplete Grade Request Form(s) have been submitted.</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">Incomplete forms for DATE are due by DATE.</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div><br></div></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Julie Stephens</b></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial" color="#999999">Coordinator, Academic Affairs + Admissions</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b><font color="#990000">Arizona State University</font>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</b></font><b style="color: rgb(255, 204, 0); font-size: 12pt;">Herberger Institute for Design and the Arts&nbsp;</b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(153, 153, 153);">P.O. Box 870405 |&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(153, 153, 153);">Tempe, Arizona 85287-0405</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#999999">Phone: 480-965-5069</font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
